  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: Represents a patient’s overall general health status (e.g., well, symptom-free, chronically ill).),(Data Element Scope: Used to record a patient's general health condition in clinical observations (e.g., HealthStatusObservation).),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes SNOMED CT concepts that clearly describe general physical health states relevant to patient assessments (e.g., “General health poor,” “General health good\").),(Exclusion Criteria: Excludes concepts that represent non-general or situational conditions, like specific diagnoses, or events not indicative of overall health status.)",
